{"unit_id":"iuuuuuuuu__dsh-coldread-cache#card-zh","repo":"iuuuuuuuu/dsh-coldread-cache","commit":"ff83ab3d9d4fd4cbb776b61a61aec7063ccd2087","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-coldread-cache（DSH 插件，适用于使用 sessionPersistence 的客户端）：为会话日志保留解析后的常驻结果，减少长会话反复整份冷读造成的等待。它挂接 DSH 的会话持久化服务，在日志未变时从内存结果返回，日志增长时只解码新增的完整帧，并为常驻缓存设置条目数和字节预算。遇到无法确认可安全增量处理的变化时，会交回后端原有读取流程。适合长会话持续写入或频繁浏览历史的场景。使用前无需 API Key；可选配置 statusFile 写诊断状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:115-116","lib/index.js:101-112","lib/index.js:1182-1200"]}
{"unit_id":"iuuuuuuuu__dsh-coldread-cache#card-en","repo":"iuuuuuuuu/dsh-coldread-cache","commit":"ff83ab3d9d4fd4cbb776b61a61aec7063ccd2087","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-coldread-cache caches parsed session logs for long DSH sessions. It attaches to sessionPersistence, reuses unchanged logs, and decodes only new complete frames after appends. Entry and byte limits bound the cache; uncertain changes fall back to the backend reader. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:115-116","lib/index.js:101-112","lib/index.js:1182-1200"]}
